# The root .gitignore is a Visual Studio one: it ignores *.meta files and any folder called
# "packages". Unity needs both committed (a .meta holds each asset's GUID, and Packages/ holds
# the project's manifest), so they're let back in for everything under unity/.
!*.meta
!/HakutakuDemo/Packages/
!/HakutakuMirrorSample/Packages/
